  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure xml:id="figure_1" ana="#home"><desc>A grand piano in a room, a curtained leaded window, an armchair and a vase of flowers behind</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#in"><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">(Licensee)</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger">Reproducing Pianos</hi></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_subhead">
        <head><hi rendition="#c #b #i #larger"><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#unreached_ideal" type="topic" resp="#claude">The Perfect Piano</seg>
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#entertainment" type="topic" resp="#claude">for Home Entertainment</seg></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/>The <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Reproducing Piano</name>
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#entertainment" type="topic" resp="#claude">makes a simple problem of home enter-
          <lb/>taining</seg>. A program by the great <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">De Pach-
          <lb/>mann</persName>—an evening with the incomparable
          <lb/><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>—or perhaps <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#dance" type="topic" resp="#claude">a delightful im-
          <lb/>promptu dance, with the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> to
          <lb/>furnish the music</seg>.</p>
        <p><lb/>With the famous <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> in your
          <lb/>home you will possess <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#unreached_ideal" type="topic" resp="#claude">the supreme instru-
          <lb/>ment of its kind</seg>. The <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> was
          <lb/>the first reproducing mechanism pro-
          <lb/>nounced perfection by the greatest artists.
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_6" ana="#superiority" type="topic" resp="#claude">Today the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> provides the
          <lb/>standard for all other reproducing actions</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_invitation">
        <ab><hi rendition="#b #i #smaller"><lb/>Come to our Music Salon and
          <lb/>let the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> play
          <lb/>for you your favorite music.</hi></ab>
      </div>
